This patch removes Firebase dependencies from package.json

To apply this manually:

1. Go to: https://github.com/joshualaurio27-rgb/BugoSyncList2026/blob/main/package.json

2. Click the pencil icon (Edit this file)

3. Find these TWO lines and DELETE them:
   
   Line to delete #1:
   "@firebase/eslint-plugin-security-rules": "^0.0.2",
   
   Line to delete #2:
   "firebase": "^13.4.0",

4. The dependencies section should look like this after deletion:

  "dependencies": {
    "@google/genai": "^3.6.1",
    "@prisma/client": "^6.6.0",
    "@tailwindcss/vite": "^4.1.14",
    ...rest stays the same...
  },

5. Scroll down and commit: "Remove Firebase dependencies"

6. Click "Commit changes"

That's it! Then GitHub will auto-trigger a webhook and Koyeb will rebuild.
